  "releaseNotes": "v2.1.1 (2026-10-25): patch release with no API changes. A float[] parameter now reaches a VECTOR(n) column as a vector instead of the literal text \"System.Single[]\", and ORDER BY vec_distance_*() LIMIT k now reaches the vector index instead of a full scan. Previous: v2.1.0 (2026-10-10): net11.0-only (C# 15 preview) with optimistic-concurrency conditional appends - IEventStore.TryAppendEventsAsync / TryAppendEventAsync with an expectedVersion, returning ConditionalAppendResult (Conflict carries the expected and actual stream lengths). This is the append-only ledger's compare-and-set primitive: a writer that lost the race is told so and nothing is written.",
